WEBVTT

13.1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.500
For anyone choosing a coding agent, the evidence leaves three practical takeaways.

13.1.2
00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:14.575
First, the harness is part of the result: a peer-reviewed study shows that changing the interface can change what the same model achieves.

13.1.3
00:00:14.875 --> 00:00:20.825
Second, no design wins everywhere; advantages reverse across models and tasks.

13.1.4
00:00:21.125 --> 00:00:26.700
Third, measure on your own work, including whether added coordination earns its cost.

13.1.5
00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:32.900
Use the references to examine the evidence, and the Feature Atlas to explore omp.

13.1.6
00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:38.200
This independent community explainer is not affiliated with Stencil Labs.

13.1.7
00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:43.075
The facts presented here are dated October eighth, twenty twenty-six.
